<title>USA: Webster shareholders okay DS Bancor merger.</title>
<headline>Webster shareholders okay DS Bancor merger.</headline>
<dateline>WATERBURY, Conn. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Webster Financial Corp said its shareholders have approved the company's  previously announced merger with DS Bancor Inc.</p>
<p>DS Bancor shareholders, who also approved the merger, will receive 1.14 shares of Webster common stock for each of their DS Bancor shares.</p>
<p>The merged bank will be a $5.2 billion institution with 79 branches.</p>
